  "description": "A technology that can tap into human consciousness is invented & people can delete one’s memory. But side effects began to show up. One of them was murdering like psychopaths. The government announced that memory controlling & deletion are illegal. And the ‘Special memory investigation agents’ were launched to investigate memory manipulation cases…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H037256629), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H037256629), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53930054), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4116001434), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8901127), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000054196)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish, [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc29828), [Spanish](https://www.webtoons.com/es/action/sinker/list?title_no=4986), Hindi",
